B.aDf=new A.bc(B.nJ,[B.aeQ,B.a5_,"Our alumni are spread out across the world and work on cutting-edge technologies. They work at a plethora of companies - from tech companies like Microsoft, Amazon, Facebook, Apple, and Google, to startups, consulting firms, financial technology firms, and more!"],t.EU)
